WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:23.831
In the afternoon the RV stopped.

2
00:00:23.832 --> 00:00:27.760
"Welcome to the mountains!" Dad said.

3
00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:33.252
All around were pine trees.

4
00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:37.096
Ahead was a clear blue lake.

5
00:00:37.097 --> 00:00:40.043
"Whoa!" Henry said.

6
00:00:40.044 --> 00:00:42.977
Rabbit was amazed.

7
00:00:42.978 --> 00:00:47.800
He looked around and saw squirrels.

8
00:00:47.801 --> 00:00:52.259
"Maybe I'll see real rabbits too!" he thought.

9
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:56.311
"Can we go swimming now?" Henry asked.

10
00:00:56.312 --> 00:01:11.687
"Sure!" Mom said.

11
00:01:11.688 --> 00:01:15.639
The family got towels.

12
00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:18.801
Then everyone went to the lake.

13
00:01:18.802 --> 00:01:21.783
Henry set Rabbit on the ground.

14
00:01:21.784 --> 00:01:30.631
Henry ran to the water and splashed in.

15
00:01:30.632 --> 00:01:35.832
Rabbit looked around while the family swam.

16
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:40.421
"These mountains are wonderful," Rabbit thought.

17
00:01:40.422 --> 00:01:44.054
"They make me want to run fast.

18
00:01:44.055 --> 00:01:49.405
But . . ." He looked down and sighed.

19
00:01:49.406 --> 00:01:52.289
"I need legs to run."

20
00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.375
The breeze felt cool and gentle.

21
00:01:55.376 --> 00:01:57.960
Rabbit closed his eyes.

22
00:01:57.961 --> 00:02:01.622
When he opened them again, he gasped.

23
00:02:01.623 --> 00:02:05.463
Several creatures were staring at him!

24
00:02:05.464 --> 00:02:10.553
The creatures had pink noses and long ears.

25
00:02:10.554 --> 00:02:14.286
Rabbit's chest thumped with excitement.

26
00:02:14.287 --> 00:02:18.153
"Real rabbits!" he said.

27
00:02:18.154 --> 00:02:23.039
"Hello!" The rabbits hopped around him.

28
00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:27.288
"Look at their strong feet!" Rabbit thought.

29
00:02:27.289 --> 00:02:30.852
"Come play with us," a brown rabbit said.

30
00:02:30.853 --> 00:02:36.541
"Yes! Jump high like me!" a white rabbit said.

31
00:02:36.542 --> 00:02:40.233
"He can't," a spotted rabbit said.

32
00:02:40.234 --> 00:02:42.667
"He doesn't have legs.

33
00:02:42.668 --> 00:02:51.784
He's not a real rabbit!"

